---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
// Converted from the OKAD case artifact. Styles are scoped under .case-designed.
const title = "16 creator videos. 48 ads to test. | OKAD Agency";
const description = "A US supplement brand sells a daily gel for gut, skin and energy, mostly through Meta ads. Their media buyers needed a steady supply of creator ads to test, and a way to tell fast which ones to scale. I wrote the scripts by angle, cast the creators, briefed their b-roll and cut every video in...";
const ogImage = "/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/face.jpg";
---

<Base title={title} description={description} ogImage={ogImage}>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  </Fragment>
  <div class="case-designed">



<!-- COVER -->
<section class="cover">
  <div class="w">
    <div class="cover-grid">
      <div class="stack" style="gap:24px">
        <span class="kick">US supplement brand · Meta ads · whitelisted creators</span>
        <h1>16 creator videos. <span class="cap g">48 ads to test.</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">A US supplement brand sells a daily gel for gut, skin and energy, mostly through Meta ads. Their media buyers needed a steady supply of creator ads to test, and a way to tell fast which ones to scale. I wrote the scripts by angle, cast the creators, briefed their b-roll and cut every video in three hook versions.</p>
        <div class="meta">
          <div><b>My scope</b><span>Angles, scripts, casting, b-roll briefs, editing, hook variations</span></div>
          <div><b>Not my scope</b><span>Media buying and creator whitelisting</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="proofgrid" aria-label="Frames from the edited ads">
        <div class="ann hand" style="right:-6px;top:-70px">same product, different angles<svg width="70" height="60" viewBox="0 0 70 60"><path d="M6 6 C 34 2, 56 18, 60 52"/><path d="M51 44 L60 54 L66 42"/></svg></div>
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="and my face is proof" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/face.jpg">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="day 1: you feel a little lighter" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/run.jpg">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="UNLESS YOU DO THIS" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/gel.jpg">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="magnesium helps your body, AI visual" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/anat.jpg">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="this is my sixth jar" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/sixth.jpg">
        <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="just straight up glow support" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/glow.jpg">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="strip">
      <div><b>16</b><span>creator videos edited</span></div>
      <div><b>48</b><span>ad versions, three hooks each</span></div>
      <div><b>8+</b><span>creators cast in the US</span></div>
      <div><b>15+</b><span>scripts across 8 angles</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Q1 -->
<section class="dew">
  <div class="w">
    <div class="stack">
      <span class="q-kick">Q1 · What do you test first?</span>
      <h2>The reason to buy, <span class="cap g">not the creator.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">One product solves different problems for different people. Someone wants clearer skin, someone wants to stop feeling bloated, someone just wants to keep up at the gym. I split the scripts into angles: flavor, gut health, skin, energy, immunity, lungs, gym and a special offer. Each angle got its own creator and its own setting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="fmt-grid">
      <div class="fmt"><figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="just straight up glow support" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/glow.jpg"></figure><span class="lbl proof">Skin</span><h3>"Glow support"</h3><p>Outdoors, natural light, no makeup talk. Just the result.</p></div>
      <div class="fmt"><figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="day 1: you feel a little lighter" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/run.jpg"></figure><span class="lbl proof">Gut and energy</span><h3>"Day 1: lighter"</h3><p>A morning run with a day by day timeline on screen.</p></div>
      <div class="fmt"><figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="your lungs work for you" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/dog.jpg"></figure><span class="lbl native">Lungs</span><h3>"Your lungs work for you"</h3><p>A guy, a dog, a ball. Health shown as play.</p></div>
      <div class="fmt"><figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="what they've been missing" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/pool.jpg"></figure><span class="lbl native">Gym</span><h3>"What they've been missing"</h3><p>A male angle for a product most people think is for women.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Q2 -->
<section>
  <div class="w">
    <div class="stack">
      <span class="q-kick">Q2 · Why three hooks per video?</span>
      <h2>The first second <span class="cap y">decides everything.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">If the hook fails, the ad never gets a chance to sell. So every creator video left the edit in three versions with the same body and a different opening. The media buyers launched all three, and the data picked the winner instead of my taste.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="insights">
      <div class="ins">
        <div class="quote">"UNLESS YOU DO THIS"<small>A WARNING OVER A PRODUCT SHOT</small></div>
        <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="64" height="24" viewBox="0 0 64 24"><path d="M3 14 C 20 9, 40 16, 58 11"/><path d="M50 4 L59 11 L50 18"/></svg></div>
        <figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="UNLESS YOU DO THIS" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/gel.jpg"></figure>
        <p><b>Curiosity.</b> A spoon of gel and half a sentence. You stay to find out what &quot;this&quot; is.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ins dark">
        <div class="quote">"and my face is proof"<small>A CLOSE-UP SELFIE</small></div>
        <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="64" height="24" viewBox="0 0 64 24"><path d="M3 14 C 20 9, 40 16, 58 11"/><path d="M50 4 L59 11 L50 18"/></svg></div>
        <figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="and my face is proof" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/face.jpg"></figure>
        <p><b>Proof.</b> The result is on screen before any claim is made.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ins">
        <div class="quote">"this is my sixth jar"<small>A MIRROR SELFIE</small></div>
        <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="64" height="24" viewBox="0 0 64 24"><path d="M3 14 C 20 9, 40 16, 58 11"/><path d="M50 4 L59 11 L50 18"/></svg></div>
        <figure class="ph"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="this is my sixth jar" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/sixth.jpg"></figure>
        <p><b>Loyalty.</b> Someone who bought it six times is a better argument than any ingredient list.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Q3 -->
<section class="dew">
  <div class="w two">
    <div class="stack">
      <span class="q-kick">Q3 · How do you show something you can't see?</span>
      <h2>An AI look <span class="cap g">inside the body.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Minerals and gut health happen where no camera goes. So between the creator shots I cut in short AI visuals of the body, with one simple line on top: "magnesium helps your body". Then back to the creator, with a timeline that makes the change feel real: day 1, week 2.</p>
      <p class="pro"><b>For marketers</b>Supplement ads live on claims, and claims are what platforms restrict. Showing a routine and a feeling, then letting a creator say it in her own words, kept the ads both believable and safe.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="trio">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AI body visual, magnesium helps your body" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/anat.jpg">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="not from a serum" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/serum.jpg">
      <img loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="more balanced overall" src="/images/cases/supplement-brand-ugc-ad-testing/sm/balanced.jpg">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Q4 -->
<section>
  <div class="w two">
    <div class="stack">
      <span class="q-kick">Q4 · What did creators actually film?</span>
      <h2>A shot list <span class="cap v">with a story arc.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">Every creator got a brief for 10 to 15 second b-roll clips, filmed on a phone during a normal day. The clips weren't random. Together they move from heavy and uncomfortable to light and more like yourself, so an editor can build a before and after from any set.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <span class="tag hand-lbl">from one gut health brief</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Post-meal discomfort, a hand on the stomach</li>
        <li>Adjusting a tight waistband after dinner</li>
        <li>Clearing takeout boxes, wiping the counter</li>
        <li>A simple breakfast with the jar on the table</li>
        <li>Walking outside, lighter body language</li>
        <li>A mirror check, more comfortable in your clothes</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Twelve shots in the full brief. The jar appears naturally, not in every frame.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Q5 -->
<section class="dew">
  <div class="w">
    <div class="stack">
      <span class="q-kick">Q5 · How does a creator become a monthly partner?</span>
      <h2>Small tests first, <span class="cap g">then a pack.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">The brand ran a clear ladder for every creator, and my edits fed it. Nobody got a big contract before the numbers showed they could sell.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="timeline" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)">
      <div><span class="s">phase 1</span><b>1 to 3 videos</b><span class="q">Proven scripts only. The creator moves on when one ad hits the team's target.</span></div>
      <div><span class="s">phase 2</span><b>2 more videos</b><span class="q">One new script and one freestyle. Another winner is needed to go further.</span></div>
      <div><span class="s">pack</span><b>Monthly pack + whitelisting</b><span class="q">A monthly deal, and the creator's account runs the ads.</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="learn">
      <div class="box"><span class="tag hand-lbl">learned</span><h3>Test angles, not faces</h3><p>A good creator on the wrong angle loses. The angle is the first thing to find.</p></div>
      <div class="box"><span class="tag hand-lbl">learned</span><h3>Three hooks are cheap</h3><p>Re-cutting the first seconds takes minutes and gives every video three chances instead of one.</p></div>
      <div class="box"><span class="tag hand-lbl">learned</span><h3>Brief the arc</h3><p>B-roll filmed as a story from heavy to light is easy to cut into a before and after.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- OFFER -->
<section>
  <div class="w">
    <div class="offer">
      <span class="q-kick">Q6 · What would this look like for you?</span>
      <h2>Find the angle. <span class="cap g">Then scale the creator.</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">For health, wellness and supplement brands running paid social. I build a pipeline of creator ads with hooks ready to test, so your media buyers always have the next round.</p>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><span class="mono">step 1</span><b>Angles</b><p>Every reason someone would buy.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="mono">step 2</span><b>Scripts</b><p>One per angle, written for real people.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="mono">step 3</span><b>Cast</b><p>Creators who match each angle.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="mono">step 4</span><b>Edit x3</b><p>Three hooks on every video.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><span class="mono">step 5</span><b>Scale</b><p>Winners become monthly packs.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="https://calendly.com/okad_calls/first" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Book a call</a><a class="btn" href="/#offer" style="background:#fff">10 videos · $500</a><span class="hn"><span style="flex:none"><svg width="54" height="22" viewBox="0 0 54 22"><path d="M51 12 C 36 16, 20 7, 5 11"/><path d="M13 4 L4 11 L12 18"/></svg></span><span class="hand">start here</span></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<p class="w case-foot">OKAD · Brand name withheld at the client's request. Frames are from the edited ads, 2025 to 2026.</p>


  </div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
.case-designed{margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff}
.case-designed img{max-width:100%}
.case-designed .case-foot{padding-block:28px 44px;color:var(--soft);font-size:.85rem;max-width:1180px}
.case-designed .cta .btn + .btn{color:#111}
.case-designed{color-scheme:light}.case-designed{margin:0;padding:0;font:14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;background:#faf9f5;color:#141413}.case-designed img{max-width:100%}.case-designed [hidden]:not([hidden=until-found i]){display:none!important}

/* OKAD house style: white page, Instrument Serif caps for headlines, Instrument Sans for reading,
   Reenie Beanie for hand-written notes with drawn arrows. Pastel outline marks the key words;
   dew-green bands and black cards create rhythm. */
.case-designed{
  --paper:#ffffff; --card:#f4f4f1; --ink:#111111; --soft:#5f5f5b; --rule:#e6e6e1;
  --dew:#eefb6e; --dew-ink:#111111; --on-dew-card:#ffffff;
  --yel:#f2fa5a; --mint:#b5f5c6; --lav:#d4d4fc; --peach:#ffe2ad; --lilac:#ecc8fa;
  --hi:var(--dew); --hi-ink:#111111; --pink:#111111;
  --c1:#8f4fd6; --c2:#17904f;
  --stage:#121114; --stage-ink:#f4f4f0; --stage-soft:#b9b9b3;
  --good:#17904f; --mid:#c98a14; --bad:#d03e3e;
  --display:"Instrument Serif","Times New Roman",serif;
  --body:"Instrument Sans","Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
  --hand:"Reenie Beanie","Bradley Hand",cursive;
  --mono:var(--body);
  --r:28px;
}
.case-designed{color-scheme:light}

.case-designed *{box-sizing:border-box}
.case-designed{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body);font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin:0}
.case-designed .w{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding-inline:20px}
.case-designed section{padding-block:96px;position:relative}
.case-designed p{margin:0;max-width:64ch}
.case-designed h1,.case-designed h2{font-family:var(--display);font-weight:400;margin:0;line-height:.94;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.012em;text-wrap:balance}
.case-designed h1{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6.4vw,5.6rem)}
.case-designed h2{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,4.9vw,4.1rem)}
.case-designed h3{font-family:var(--body);font-style:italic;font-weight:600;font-size:1.16rem;line-height:1.2;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.005em}
.case-designed .kick{font-family:var(--body);font-size:.92rem;color:var(--soft)}
.case-designed .lead{font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--soft);max-width:60ch}
.case-designed .stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px}
.case-designed .mono{font-family:var(--body);font-size:.8rem}
.case-designed .q-kick{font-family:var(--body);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:1rem;color:var(--soft)}
.case-designed .pro{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--soft);background:var(--card);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 18px 16px;max-width:70ch}
.case-designed .dew .pro{background:rgba(255,255,255,.55)}
.case-designed .pro b{display:block;font-family:var(--hand);font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:1.7rem;line-height:.9;color:var(--ink);margin-bottom:2px}
.case-designed details.more{margin-top:32px}
.case-designed details.more summary{cursor:pointer;font-family:var(--body);font-weight:600;list-style:none;display:inline-flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
.case-designed details.more summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.case-designed details.more summary::after{content:"+"}
.case-designed details.more[open] summary::after{content:"-"}
.case-designed .howto{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 22px;margin-top:26px;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--soft)}
.case-designed .howto b{color:var(--ink);font-style:normal;font-weight:600}

/* key words: thick pastel outline traced around the letters */
.case-designed .cap{--hl:transparent;color:inherit}
.case-designed .cap.g,.case-designed .cap.p,.case-designed .cap.y,.case-designed .cap.v,.case-designed h1 .cap.g{color:#111;text-shadow:0.090em 0.000em 1px var(--hl),0.087em 0.023em 1px var(--hl),0.078em 0.045em 1px var(--hl),0.064em 0.064em 1px var(--hl),0.045em 0.078em 1px var(--hl),0.023em 0.087em 1px var(--hl),0.000em 0.090em 1px var(--hl),-0.023em 0.087em 1px var(--hl),-0.045em 0.078em 1px var(--hl),-0.064em 0.064em 1px var(--hl),-0.078em 0.045em 1px var(--hl),-0.087em 0.023em 1px var(--hl),-0.090em 0.000em 1px var(--hl),-0.087em -0.023em 1px var(--hl),-0.078em -0.045em 1px var(--hl),-0.064em -0.064em 1px var(--hl),-0.045em -0.078em 1px var(--hl),-0.023em -0.087em 1px var(--hl),-0.000em -0.090em 1px var(--hl),0.023em -0.087em 1px var(--hl),0.045em -0.078em 1px var(--hl),0.064em -0.064em 1px var(--hl),0.078em -0.045em 1px var(--hl),0.087em -0.023em 1px var(--hl),0.050em 0.000em 0 var(--hl),0.043em 0.025em 0 var(--hl),0.025em 0.043em 0 var(--hl),0.000em 0.050em 0 var(--hl),-0.025em 0.043em 0 var(--hl),-0.043em 0.025em 0 var(--hl),-0.050em 0.000em 0 var(--hl),-0.043em -0.025em 0 var(--hl),-0.025em -0.043em 0 var(--hl),-0.000em -0.050em 0 var(--hl),0.025em -0.043em 0 var(--hl),0.043em -0.025em 0 var(--hl);padding-inline:.04em}
.case-designed .cap.g{--hl:var(--mint)} .case-designed .cap.p{--hl:var(--lilac)} .case-designed .cap.y{--hl:var(--peach)} .case-designed .cap.v{--hl:var(--lav)}
.case-designed h1 .cap.g{--hl:var(--yel)}
.case-designed .dew .cap.g,.case-designed .dew .cap.p,.case-designed .dew .cap.y,.case-designed .dew .cap.v{--hl:#ffffff}

/* hand-written notes */
.case-designed .hand{font-family:var(--hand);font-size:2.1rem;line-height:.95;color:var(--ink);font-weight:400}
.case-designed .ann{position:absolute;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:flex-end;pointer-events:none;z-index:2}
.case-designed .ann svg,.case-designed .hn svg,.case-designed .arrow svg{fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;overflow:visible}
.case-designed .hn{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--ink)}

/* phone frames */
.case-designed .ph{position:relative;aspect-ratio:9/16;max-width:100%;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;background:#000}
.case-designed .ph img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.case-designed .ph figcaption{position:absolute;left:8px;bottom:8px;right:8px;font-size:.7rem;color:#fff;background:rgba(0,0,0,.55);padding:4px 7px;border-radius:6px;line-height:1.3}
.case-designed figure{margin:0}

/* dew bands + black cards */
.case-designed .dew{background:var(--dew);color:var(--dew-ink);--ink:#111;--soft:#3d3f22;--card:var(--on-dew-card);--rule:rgba(17,17,17,.12)}
.case-designed .dark,.case-designed .box.dark,.case-designed .ins.dark{background:var(--stage)!important;color:var(--stage-ink);--ink:var(--stage-ink);--soft:var(--stage-soft);--rule:rgba(255,255,255,.14)}

/* cover */
.case-designed .cover{padding-block:28px 84px}
.case-designed .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding-block:20px}
.case-designed .logo{font-family:var(--display);font-size:1.7rem;letter-spacing:.02em}
.case-designed .cover-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.05fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;margin-top:28px}
.case-designed .collage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:10px;position:relative}
.case-designed .collage .ph:nth-child(even){transform:translateY(28px)}
.case-designed .meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px 24px;margin-top:8px}
.case-designed .meta div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:48px minmax(0,1fr);column-gap:12px;row-gap:2px;align-content:start;min-width:0;background:var(--card);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 16px}
.case-designed .meta div svg{grid-row:1 / span 2;width:48px;height:48px;fill:none;stroke:#111;stroke-width:1.6;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;overflow:visible}
.case-designed .meta div svg .blob{stroke:none}
.case-designed .meta b{font-weight:600}
.case-designed .meta span{color:var(--soft);font-size:.92rem}

/* stat strip */
.case-designed .strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--r);margin-top:72px}
.case-designed .strip div{padding:26px 26px 24px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule)}
.case-designed .strip div:last-child{border-right:0}
.case-designed .strip b{display:block;font-family:var(--display);font-style:italic;font-size:3.6rem;font-weight:400;line-height:.95;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.case-designed .strip span{color:var(--soft);font-size:.92rem}

/* boxes */
.case-designed .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:start}
.case-designed .two>*{min-width:0}
.case-designed .before-after{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
.case-designed .box{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--r);padding:26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;min-width:0}
.case-designed .box p{color:var(--soft)}
.case-designed .box ul{margin:0;padding-left:0;list-style:none;color:var(--soft);display:grid;gap:10px}
.case-designed .box li{background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;padding:10px 14px}
.case-designed .dew .box li{background:var(--card)}
.case-designed .dark li,.case-designed .box.dark li{background:rgba(255,255,255,.07)!important}
